The '''Judgement Core''' is a {{Legendary}} item used to craft the {{Item|Terminator}}. It is a {{Odds|pray|nameonly=y}} drop from the {{MobSprite|Voidgloom Seraph}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
The '''Judgement Core''' has a {{Green|0.06%}} ({{Green|1}}/{{Yellow|1,771.12}}) chance to drop from {{Stier|4}} {{MobSprite|Voidgloom Seraph}} if the player has unlocked {{Coll|Enderman Slayer LVL 7}}.

=== Raffle of the Century ===
'''Judgement Core''' can also be obtained as a {{Gold|'''MEDIUM'''}} reward from [[Raffle of the Century]].

