== Trivia ==
*The '''Judgement Core''' resembles the [https://theportalwiki.com/wiki/Anger_Core Anger Core] from [[w:Portal|Portal]], though more visually resembles a Core from [[w:Portal 2|''Portal 2'']].
*The '''Judgement Core''' references ''Terminator 2: Judgement Day'' as it is the primary component in crafting the {{Item|Terminator}}.

